# Security & governance files
/SECURITY.md            @fanoryu
/LICENSE                @fanoryu
/PROPRIETARY-LICENSE-NOTICE.md  @fanoryu
/CONTRIBUTING.md        @fanoryu

# Documentation
/docs/                  @fanoryu
